  "The files (first 12 characters of each fingerprint): 0e8fae3d4911 on 17 works, 8e8d24926240 on 2 works, e6e0d87bdd0b on 1 work.",
  "The works are recorded as: Soak Pit (18), Rooftop Water Harvesting Structure (2).",
  "The entries were made by 3 different offices: CEO ZILA PARISHAD, Deputy Commissioner, Dy DEO ele. Fdk.",
  "These works are spread over 3 states: Karnataka, Punjab, Rajasthan."
